{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight 737 - MAXIMUM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is designed for those who do not want to fly a plane and deal with many complicated procedures, but want to be able to control everything in a simplified way.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily Use the 737 Passenger Aircraft and Feel Like a Pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total 5 Continents and 50 Different Airports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autopilot feature with detailed controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Functional Co-Pilot support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight plan and checklist that changes for each flight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FMC, Fuel data, ICAO, Leg Vectors, Flight number, Heading, IAS/Mach and Vertical Speed \u200b\u200bdetails</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed lighting options inside and outside the cockpit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wireless frequency and radio usage, communication with the tower, ground services and flight crew. Refueling, De-icing, Pushback Operations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passenger and Cargo Transportation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cabin Pressure, ALIGN and IRS Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigation System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Audio and Visual Alerts for the Aircraft</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun Flight Physics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Preparation, Taxiing, Takeoff, Cruise and Landing Scenario</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to Set Flight Duration, Weather Conditions and Your Own Crash Simulation if You Want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to Land from Any Airport to Any Airport</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active Air Traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-Landing Procedures and the Task of Parking the Aircraft Correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design Your Own Aircraft Image and Use It in the Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Realistic and Full Flight Controller Support</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Many Gamepads in Addition to Keyboard and Mouse. Also Provides Full Support for Logitech Extreme 3D and Thrustmaster TCA Airbus Edition Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fun Not Limited to Passenger Aircraft</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game Offers Realistic Helicopter and Different Missions. There is also Retro Jet Fighter (Advanced) Fighter plane game and Forklift Operator Missions as Ground Services.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1925550?t=1739309414","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1925550?t=1739309414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739309414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739309414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight 737 - MAXIMUM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is designed for those who do not want to fly a plane and deal with many complicated procedures, but want to be able to control everything in a simplified way.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily Use the 737 Passenger Aircraft and Feel Like a Pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total 5 Continents and 50 Different Airports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autopilot feature with detailed controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Functional Co-Pilot support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight plan and checklist that changes for each flight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FMC, Fuel data, ICAO, Leg Vectors, Flight number, Heading, IAS/Mach and Vertical Speed \u200b\u200bdetails</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >De